<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>

<head>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: sans-serif;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .header {
            background: #f4f4f4;
            padding: 10px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .content {
            padding: 20px 0;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .button {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 10px 20px;
            background-color: #007bff;
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 5px;
        }

        .address {
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .footer {
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #888;
            text-align: center;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h1>Confirm your new email address</h1>
        </div>
        <div class="content">
            <p>Hi,</p>
            <p>
                Someone asked to change the email address on a Jovi Mall account to
                <span class="address">{{newEmail}}</span>.
            </p>
            <p>Confirm it below and this address becomes the one you sign in with.</p>
            <p>
                <a href="{{link}}" class="button">Confirm this address</a>
            </p>
            <p>The link expires in {{hours}} hour(s).</p>
            <p>
                If you did not ask for this, ignore this message — nothing has changed,
                and the account still signs in with its current address.
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="footer">
            <p>&copy; {{year}} Jovi Mall. All rights reserved.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>

</html>
